*                        SOFTWARE TRACK OVERFLOW.  OPEN FORMS A SEGMENT 13996000
*                        WORK AREA POOL AND STORES THE ADDRESS OF THE   13998000
*                        SEGMENT WORK AREA CONTROL BLOCK IN THE DCBEOBW 13998400
*                        FIELD OF THE DATA CONTROL BLOCK.  WRITE USES   13998800
*                        A SEGMENT WORK AREA TO WRITE A RECORD AS ONE   13999200
*                        OR MORE SEGMENTS.                              13999600
