*                        RECORDS WITH KEYS, RECORD OFFSET PROCESSING.   13999800
*                        READ READS ONE RECORD SEGMENT INTO THE RECORD  13999900
*                        AREA.  THE FIRST SEGMENT OF A RECORD IS        14033200
*                        PRECEDED IN THE RECORD AREA BY THE KEY.        14043200
*                        SUBSEQUENT SEGMENTS ARE AT AN OFFSET EQUAL TO  14053200
*                        THE KEY LENGTH.                                14063200
JFCEXC   EQU   X'10' -   E - EXCHANGE BUFFERING                         14066700
