*                                     USE JFCBOTTR INSTEAD OF           37450000
*                                     DS1LSTAR FIELD TO REPOSITION      37500000
*                                     DATA SET IF AUTOMATIC STEP        37600000
*                                     RESTART OCCURS.  (THIS JOB HAD    37700000
*                                     ABEND PROCESSING FOR A DATA SET   37750000
*                                     OPENED FOR MOD.)               */ 37760000
